    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ef-farcĭo</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-fercio</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ec-f-</span></b> ), no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, fertus, 4, v.
			a., <i>to stuff</i>, <i>cram</i>,
				<i>fill out</i> (very rare): intervalla grandibus
			saxis, * <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G. 7, 23, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bibite, este, ecfercite vos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Most. 1, 1, 62</span></i>
			.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">effer-tus</span></b> , a, um, P. a., <i>filled out</i>, <i>full</i>, <i>ample</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fame effertus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Capt. 3, 1, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hereditas effertissima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 1, 8</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. As. 2, 2, 16</span></i>.</div>
